<title>USA: North American Savings Bank Q4 net off.</title>
<headline>North American Savings Bank Q4 net off.</headline>
<dateline>GRANDVIEW, Mo. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.57		    $0.82</p>
<p> Net			  1,288		    1,903</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,265		    2,307</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Period ended September 30.</p>
<p>1996 Q4, year results include one-time charge of $3.4 million ($2.1 million after tax) for Savings Association Insurance Fund recapitalization.  </p>
<p>			   YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			$  3.39		   $ 3.70</p>
<p> Net			  7,731		    8,545</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,279		    2,309</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 full-year results include income of $369,000 from cumulative effect of change in accounting.</p>
<p>Assets $711.1 million vs $641.8 million</p>
<p>Deposits $499.6 million vs $529.6 million</p>
<p>Loans $667.8 million vs $588.3 million</p>
